--- leo 09:33
<p>Here's roughly how a bubble gets its size:</p>
<pre><code><span style="color:#af52de">let</span> doc  = <span style="color:#007aff">LHDocument</span>(html: msg.html, css: bubbleCSS)
<span style="color:#af52de">let</span> size = doc.<span style="color:#ff9500">layout</span>(maxWidth: <span style="color:#34c759">480</span>) <span style="color:#8e8e93">// shrink-to-fit</span>
bubble.frame.size = size + insets</code></pre>
<p style="font-size: 12px; color: #8e8e93">(it's Objective-C++ really, but you get the idea)</p>

